<title>JAPAN: Japan Jan-March output seen up 1.6 pct qtr/qtr.</title>
<headline>Japan Jan-March output seen up 1.6 pct qtr/qtr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's industrial output in the January-March period is seen rising by 1.6 percent from the previous quarter and rising by 6.1 percent from the same period a year earlier, an official of the Ministry of International Trade and Industry said on Thursday.</p>
